  "description": "Sang-Gu is a student who's struggling financially and is a hypochondriac due to trauma from a childhood accident. Young-Hui, on the other hand, is the “it” girl of the famous K-Pop girl group, Sugar Red. Immediately after Young-Hui meets Sang-Gu, she chases after him because of the \"delicious\" smell he has. One single bite of your blood for 10 million won – will you take the deal? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)",
